==Quick Walkthrough==
#Go to [[Skyrim:Ivarstead|Ivarstead]].
#Climb the 7,000 Steps.
#Speak to the Greybeards at [[SR:High Hrothgar|High Hrothgar]].

==Detailed Walkthrough==

===Ivarstead===

After you're finished in [[Skyrim:Whiterun|Whiterun]], you'll want to head to [[Skyrim:Ivarstead|Ivarstead]], as it is located at the foot of the 7,000 Steps leading up to [[Skyrim:High_Hrothgar|High Hrothgar]]. Once you get there and get close to the bridge, you'll hear a conversation. Talk to one of the men, [[SR:Klimmek|Klimmek]], and learn about what dangers are lurking ahead. You can take an [[Skyrim:Climb_the_Steps|optional quest]] from him to deliver supplies to the Greybeards. You may also ask people there to tell you some information about High Hrothgar:
